msgid ""
"Windows programs (.exe and .msi) don't run here. Open one anyway: Wheelhouse "
"tells you the version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement when there is one, and"
" installs it."
msgstr ""
"Los programas de Windows (.exe y .msi) no funcionan aquí. Abra uno de todos "
"modos: Wheelhouse le indica la versión para EvenKeelOS, o un sustituto cuando"
