#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add System Tools to the logo menu"
msgstr "Añadir Herramientas del sistema al menú del logotipo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add six more topics to the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Añadir seis temas más a la guía de EvenKeelOS"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Turn New to Linux into the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Convertir Nuevo en Linux en la guía de EvenKeelOS"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add the New to Linux guide in System Tools and at login"
msgstr "Añadir la guía Nuevo en Linux en Herramientas del sistema y al iniciar sesión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Boot options: common fixes and your own settings"
msgstr "Añadir Opciones de arranque: soluciones comunes y tus propios ajustes"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the Shared folders build check: no home folders yet"
msgstr "Corregir la comprobación de compilación de Carpetas compartidas: aún no hay carpetas personales"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Shared folders: share home folders on Home networks"
msgstr "Añadir Carpetas compartidas: compartir carpetas personales en redes de tipo Casa"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Network safety: Home, Work or Public place"
msgstr "Añadir Seguridad de la red: Casa, Trabajo o Lugar público"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize printer drivers in any folder"
msgstr "Reconocer controladores de impresora en cualquier carpeta"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show tool windows inside System Tools"
msgstr "Mostrar las ventanas de herramientas dentro de Herramientas del sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open an issue when the image build fails"
msgstr "Abrir una incidencia cuando falla la compilación de la imagen"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Lock outside packages and the ISO tool to exact versions"
msgstr "Fijar los paquetes externos y la herramienta de ISO a versiones exactas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Name tool windows after the tool, shorter test list"
msgstr "Poner a las ventanas de herramientas el nombre de la herramienta, lista de pruebas más corta"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Repair deleted system settings and alert on certificates"
msgstr "Reparar ajustes del sistema borrados y avisar sobre certificados"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Reunir todas las herramientas en una sola ventana de Herramientas del sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "No dejar nada atrás al eliminar una VPN"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Añadir Obtener una VPN, con VPN que siguen actualizándose"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Dar a las reuniones de Zoom su propia guía"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Abrir las reuniones de Zoom en Chrome, en la versión web de Zoom"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Evitar que las instalaciones de ArtCraft rompan las de Flathub"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Reconocer instaladores por su nombre de archivo habitual"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Ofrecer alternativas en Linux a los programas de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Corregir la configuración de la caja: distrobox monta mal las carpetas de solo lectura"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Ofrecer versiones de Fedora o Ubuntu de los programas de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Ofrecer la versión de Linux al abrir un programa de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Incluir un solo shim, para que el firmware no añada otra entrada de Fedora"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Restaurar la zona del cortafuegos de Fedora"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Reforzar los asistentes de root, el cortafuegos y las actualizaciones sin contraseña"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Nuevos valores predeterminados: fondos de pantalla, carpetas de color de énfasis, pantalla de bloqueo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Nuevo valor predeterminado: color de énfasis verde azulado, también en la pantalla de inicio de sesión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Corregir la nota de reversión, el bucle de inicio de sesión y las pruebas atascadas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Corregir la reversión por bloqueo y reducir los reintentos a 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Corregir las pruebas de reversión automática"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Pruebas de fallo reales para la reversión automática"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Añadir reversión automática con greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Iniciar la disposición de Windows en el escritorio, y pequeñas correcciones"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Pausar las actualizaciones automáticas durante 3 días tras una reversión"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Añadir un paso de Disposición del escritorio al instalador"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Añadir Disposición del escritorio a Herramientas del sistema"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Evitar que los cambios de modo de energía esperen a las actualizaciones"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Añadir una disposición opcional al estilo de Windows"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Corregir los ajustes predefinidos de Fedora 45 y las rutas de la política de contenedores"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Leer las fuentes de descarga en la nueva carpeta de Fedora 45"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Pasar a Fedora 45"
